{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03259","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮屠应制 · 宋之问","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮屠应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤刹侵云半，虹旌倚日边。\n散花多宝塔，张乐布金田。\n时菊芳仙酝，秋兰动睿篇。\n香街稍欲晚，清跸扈归天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}